# Prisma schema isolation

This project shares the same database URL with another app. All tables must live in the PostgreSQL schema `customer` only.

## Required for every model

- Add **`@@schema("customer")`** at the end of every `model` block. Never omit it.
- Do not add models to `public` or any schema other than `customer`.

## Example

```prisma
model Post {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  title     String
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@schema("customer")
}
```

## Do not

- Run raw SQL or tooling against `public` or the other project's schema.
- Run the other project's migrations from this repo (or this repo's migrations from the other project).
